Replace break-reminder.svg with your own logo.

  - Keep the filename break-reminder.svg
  - Square canvas, 128x128 viewBox works well
  - SVG is preferred: it stays sharp at every size a desktop asks for

A PNG works too. Name it break-reminder.png at 256x256 or larger, and change
"scalable" to "256x256" in the ICONDIR line of install.sh and build-deb.sh.

Try it without installing:
  cp your-logo.svg icons/break-reminder.svg
  ./install.sh && break-reminder
